-## Next phase: factories
-
-Do not infer the cost of a fabricator from its inclusive time alone: compare
-call counts, nested calls, and callbacks with `FPROF=1` (one directory per
-run). In models, revisit repeated status and account setup (especially the
-cleanup policy, tag feed, and trends specs). In requests, inspect the repeated
-creation of users and API tokens and whether their associated data is needed
